{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2th-2-1","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul urges them to continue stedfast in the truth received; 3 shows that there shall be a departure from the faith, 9 and a discovery of Antichrist, before the day of the Lord come; 15 and thereupon repeats his former exhortation, and prays for them.</p>\n<p>we. Ro 12:1 by the. 1Th 4:14-16 and by. Ge 49:10; Mt 24:31; 25:32; Mr 13:27; Eph 1:10; 1Th 3:13; 4:17 2Ti 4:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-2","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>shaken. Isa 7:2; 8:12,13; 26:3; Mt 24:6; Mr 13:7; Lu 21:9,19; Joh 14:1,27 Ac 20:23,24; Eph 5:6; 1Th 3:3 by spirit. De 13:1-5; Jer 23:25-27; Mic 2:11; Mt 24:4,5,24; 2Pe 2:1-3 1Jo 4:1,2; Re 19:20 nor by letter. 1Th 4:15; 2Pe 3:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-3","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>no man. Mt 24:4-6; 1Co 6:9; Eph 5:6 except. 1Ti 4:1-3; 2Ti 3:1-3; 4:3,4 man. 8-10; Da 7:25; 1Jo 2:18; Re 13:11-18 the son. Joh 17:12; Re 17:8,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-4","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>and exalteth. Isa 14:13; Eze 28:2,6,9; Da 7:8,25; 8:9-11; 11:36; Re 13:6 called. 1Co 8:5 sitteth. Da 8:12-14; 11:45; Re 13:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-5","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Remember. Mt 16:9; Mr 8:18; Lu 24:6,7; Ac 20:31 when. 3:10; Joh 16:4; Ga 5:21; 1Th 2:11; 2Pe 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-6","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>withholdeth. or, holdeth. 7 revealed. 3,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-7","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the mystery. 1Ti 3:16; Re 17:5,7 doth. Ac 20:29; Col 2:18-23; 2Ti 2:17,18; 1Jo 2:18; 4:3 he who. 6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-8","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>that. 3; Mt 13:19,38; 1Jo 2:13; 3:12; 5:18 whom. Da 7:10,11,26; Re 18:8-10; 19:20; 20:10 the spirit. Job 4:9; Ps 18:15; Isa 11:4; Ho 6:5; Re 1:16; 2:16; 19:15,20,21 with the brightness. 1:8,9; Heb 10:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-9","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>is. Joh 8:41,44; Ac 8:9-11; 13:10; 2Co 4:4; 11:3,14; Eph 2:2; Re 9:11 Re 12:9,17; 13:1-5; 18:23; 19:20; 20:10 and signs. Ex 7:22; 8:7,18; De 13:1,2; Mt 24:24; Mr 13:22; 2Ti 3:8; Re 13:11-15 Re 18:23; 19:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-10","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>deceivableness. Ro 16:18; 2Co 2:17; 4:2; 11:13,15; Eph 4:14; 2Pe 2:18; Heb 3:13 in them. 1Co 1:18; 2Co 2:15; 4:3; 2Pe 2:12 they received. Pr 1:7; 2:1-6; 4:5,6; 8:17; Mt 13:11; Joh 3:19-21; 8:45-47; Ro 2:7,8 Ro 6:17; 1Co 16:22; Jas 1:16-18 that they. Joh 3:17; 5:34; Ro 10:1; 1Th 2:16; 1Ti 2:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-11","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>for. Ps 81:11,12; 109:17; Isa 29:9-14; Joh 12:39-43; Ro 1:21-25,28 God. 1Ki 22:18-2