h 3:16; 13:1; 15:9,13; Ro 5:8; Eph 2:4,5; 5:2,25; Tit 3:4-7 1Jo 3:16; 4:9,10; Re 1:5; 3:9 everlasting. Ps 103:17; Isa 35:10; 51:11; 60:19,20; 61:7; Lu 16:25; Joh 4:14 Joh 14:16-18; 16:22; 2Co 4:17,18; Heb 6:18; 1Pe 1:5-8; Re 7:16,17 Re 22:5 good. Ro 5:2-5; 8:24,25; Col 1:5,23; 1Th 1:3; Tit 1:2; 2:13; Heb 6:11 Heb 6:12,19; 7:19; 1Pe 1:3-5; 1Jo 3:2,3 through. Ac 15:11; 18:27; Ro 4:4,16; 5:2; 11:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2th-2-17","title":"2 Thessalonians 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2TH","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Comfort. 16; Isa 51:3,12; 57:15; 61:1,2; 66:13; Ro 15:13; 2Co 1:3-6 stablish. 3:3; Isa 62:7; Ro 1:11; 16:25; 1Co 1:8; 2Co 1:21; Col 2:7; 1Th 3:2,13 Heb 13:9; 1Pe 5:10; Jude 1:24 in. Jas 1:21,22; 1Jo 3:18</p>"}]}